{"step_index":1079,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:47:35Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T17:47:35-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T17:47:40-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T17:47:35-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T17:47:40-05:00\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\n0094c57a: Donnie's Drop\r\n02a01b29: Powerful revolver with a subtle patriotic design, purchased at Phil's Ammu-Nation in Southside.\r\n048935d2: Phil's Ammu-Nation\r\n06bf12a2: Free new styles are available at any salon ~1b~ and a weapon wrap is available at any Ammu-Nation ~2b~\r\n0e76b2c9: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n0ec460af: Tactical Gunfire\r\n10356152: Working for Brian will require some gear from Ammu-Nation. Pick up a longarm at Chuck's Tackle & Shot.\r\n120ad52b: Buy cosmetic upgrades for 5 sidearms and 5 longarms at Ammu-Nation.\r\n1e9fc125: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n2522a57e: Drop off the narcotics at Brian's lockup ~1b~ to earn money.\r\n25b05875: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n284f7970: Tactical shotgun with a wooden furniture, used but in great condition. Purchased at Vice City Gun & Pawn in Rockridge.\r\n3071c4d9: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n314d5347: Assault rifle with a custom American flag wrap, purchased at Phil's Ammu-Nation in Southside.\r\n338d0003: Donnie's trusty revolver, found stashed in the trunk of his car in Key Lento.\r\n387b87ee: Go to the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~\r\n38e1b069: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n3a78467d: Jason and Dre'Quan inflitrate Dante Fresh's mansion and steal the blackmail material he has on Royce Jones. They meet with Royce's assistant, Briana, who says the Dimez will headline VYB's reopening launch party soon.\r\n4353e33f: Ammu-Nation\r\n44c78013: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n4742becd: Go back to the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s~\r\n4d1c5c63: Ammu-Nation\r\n5044bf86: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\n505db1ce: Leave the ~o~Ammu-Nation~s\n<truncated 4089 bytes>\nt to Pay 'n' Spray, and drops it at Brian's storage.\r\nd0b48b3f: Donnie Recover Drop\r\nd22eff87: Ammu-Nation\r\nd273288b: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nd5c6c443: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nd7856045: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nd882639d: ~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ weapons are now available. Pick them up from your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ or at an Ammu-Nation ~1b~ weapon locker.\r\ne3c25cdc: ~b~Ammu-Nations~b~ sell guns, mods, ammo, and more.\r\ne4d917af: Hey this is Joey from Coastal Auto Care. Cal mentioned your car might need some work, let me know. Here's my spot.\r\ne8f0f4ec: ~b~Tip:~b~ Use a weapon locker ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSON_WEAPON_LOCKER~ at an Ammu-Nation to recover owned weapons and manage your loadout.\r\neaa187b3: A new ~b~Ultimate Edition~b~ unique weapon variant ~BLIP_STYLE_PICKUP_WEAP_COLLECT~ is available at any Ammu-Nation weapon locker.\r\neab842ac: Donnie's Drop\r\nec632eb7: Work with Cal to recover a car from a police impound lot for Brian.\r\nf46af3cd: Make an Ammu-Nation Purchase\r\nf4a4149a: Donnie got a signal from a missing drug drop somewhere in Pelican Valley. Find the package and drop it off safely.\r\nf613ed62: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nf7556551: Kenton, the treasure hunter you met at Brian's, has work available. Drop by his place in Key Lento.\r\nf7dadd50: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nf7deac2b: ~b~Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~~b~ will expand their stock as you purchase more weapons.\r\nf9875a2d: Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.\r\nfabe8529: You can manage your loadout in your trunk ~1b~ or any Ammu-Nation ~2b~ ahead of a job.\r\nff0b2fef: Good work covering with Brian b4. Were in this 2gether remember that! Left a taste of the profits 4u in yr mailbox. And fck the king fishers. Well be fine.\r\nffca7a0d: Donnie's Trailer Drop-Off Discovered\r\nffd86b1c: Ammu-Nation\r\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
